# key.properties.template — example local key.properties for development
# Copy this file to key.properties (which is gitignored) and fill real values
# OR export the following environment variables in your CI / local shell:
#   KEYSTORE_STORE_FILE, KEYSTORE_STORE_PASSWORD, KEYSTORE_KEY_ALIAS, KEYSTORE_KEY_PASSWORD

# Example local values (uncomment and set accordingly):
# storeFile=../android/myapp-release.keystore
# storePassword=ChangeThisToYourStorePassword
# keyAlias=myapp
# keyPassword=ChangeThisToYourKeyPassword

# If using environment variables, you don't need this file at all.
